1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,965
Day 2 in
Leoville!

2
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:04,363
12 comments yesterday…

3
00:00:04,363 --> 00:00:06,214
…and you have
big plans!

4
00:00:06,554 --> 00:00:09,344
Yesterday: 57 residents.

5
00:00:09,344 --> 00:00:11,578
Today, we are 66!

6
00:00:11,918 --> 00:00:15,706
That brings
€9,033 into the budget!

7
00:00:16,046 --> 00:00:18,530
Joe asked for
a plane as a house…

8
00:00:18,530 --> 00:00:20,168
Cleared for landing!

9
00:00:20,508 --> 00:00:22,962
Iknowlightyagamiiskira asked for
a big house…

10
00:00:22,962 --> 00:00:24,137
Here it is!

11
00:00:24,477 --> 00:00:29,339
Not14redmi, Tanja and 5 more
move into the apartment block!

12
00:00:29,339 --> 00:00:32,548
Welcome PWR_Jonah and LouiePlayz!

13
00:00:32,888 --> 00:00:35,447
Erik and Alex
both want to be principal!

14
00:00:35,447 --> 00:00:38,458
Erik even has a title:
Principal Banana!

15
00:00:38,458 --> 00:00:40,673
Whoever asked first
gets the job!

16
00:00:41,013 --> 00:00:43,978
Iknowlightyagamiiskira wants to be president…

17
00:00:43,978 --> 00:00:46,188
…and Divish wants to be
the government!

18
00:00:46,188 --> 00:00:48,002
So we hold an
election!

19
00:00:48,342 --> 00:00:49,902
Dollars, Ari?

20
00:00:49,902 --> 00:00:52,565
Sorry, Leoville pays
in euros!

21
00:00:52,905 --> 00:00:54,446
And what do you
want next?

22
00:00:54,446 --> 00:00:56,273
The school is in the lead!

23
00:00:56,613 --> 00:00:59,913
The school costs
€120,000.

24
00:00:59,913 --> 00:01:02,495
Ecaterina's sister
is waiting for it!

25
00:01:02,495 --> 00:01:04,972
Keep subscribing,
and we can build it!

26
00:01:05,312 --> 00:01:06,973
Who should lead
Leoville?

27
00:01:06,973 --> 00:01:08,754
Vote in the
comments!
